1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"food-media","section":"practice","title":["食图・食影・食册","Diagrams, films and printed matter"],"date":"2025","status":["传播＋研究","Media + Research"],"summary":["图解、影像与折页，让食物研究以不同媒介被阅读和分享。","Diagrams, moving images and a foldout publication share food research through different media."],"image":"/assets/editorial/food-media.jpg","caption":["图解与展册设计呈现，汇报 PDF 第9页。","Diagram and publication design, presentation p.9."],"topic":true,"chapters":[{"title":["食图","Diagrams"],"text":["以圆桌与同心圆结构组织时令、地方环境、古籍、劳动者与菜肴，建立从田间到餐桌的阅读关系。","A circular table organizes seasons, local environments, historical texts, workers and dishes in a field-to-table narrative."]},{"title":["食影","Moving images"],"text":["影像记录大食物馆的改造过程，并呈现肉、蛋、禽、奶、鱼、果、菌、茶等食物与地方经验。当前页面展示研究介绍，暂未上线完整影片。","Films document the pavilion’s adaptation and local experiences of diverse foods. This page introduces the work; the complete films are not yet available here."]},{"title":["食册","Printed matter"],"text":["展册汇集大食物馆的展项，通过折叠与圆形图解组织阅读。出版物与影像作为独立成果，关联相应展览与项目。","The publication brings together pavilion exhibits through folding and circular diagrams. It is linked to the relevant exhibitions and projects."]}],"related":["milan-food","diverse-foods"],"sources":["award","overview"]}}]
